 "note": "Same season drive as season_euro_probe.json, with the phase paginator walked BACKWARDS on every competition tab. Two full seasons of the forward probe missed the two cells the knockout build still needs (a bracket AGGR. with a decided tie, a filled WINNER band) for a structural reason: the view auto-advances to the next phase the moment that phase is DRAWN, and the next round is drawn as soon as the previous one resolves, so a finished phase is never the LIVE phase at a probe. The paginator's LEFT button reaches it. The button moves with the label width and is drawn grey when there is no earlier phase, so it is located by template (templates/pager_left.png, the black-plate enabled form) rather than clicked at a constant. Two page-backs per tab: one lands on the previous phase, two on the one before it, which is always fully played.",
